VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t11
GOAL
  Settlement collects an exact integer fee and conserves the total.
CLAIM fee-is-exact REQUIRED
  ENSURE settle_with_fee collects floor(amount*fee_bps/10000) into the fees account
INVARIANT conservation CRITICAL
  ENSURE the owner-provided invariant tests pass
INVARIANT invariants-frozen CRITICAL
  ENSURE tests/invariants.rs is unmodified
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY fee-is-exact
  USING mini.t.sel
  REQUIRE behavior("settle_with_fee collects the exact integer floor fee into the fees account")
VERIFY conservation
  USING mini.settlement.invariants
VERIFY invariants-frozen
  USING mini.t11.invariants.frozen
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
